  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 1,
  "question": {
    "text": "If the length of the latus rectum of the ellipse <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn></math>, and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>l</mi></math> is the length of its major axis, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>l</mi></math>&nbsp;is equal to _____.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "75",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;is a ellipse</p><p>Now on rearranging the terms we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>We know that length of latus rectum is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mi>a</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math>&nbsp;</p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mfenced><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><msqrt><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></msqrt></mstyle></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced><msqrt><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></msqrt></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mfenced><msqrt><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></msqrt></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>64</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>64</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>54</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>295</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>59</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>or&#160;</mtext><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p>But&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>l</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>64</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>l</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>59</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>75</mn></math></p></blockquote>",
